 "intent": "COLOR/THEME: a deliberately light-appropriate hardcoded palette - #fafafa panel background, near-white #f4f6f8 bar fills, pale #dddddd gridlines and boundaries, #333333 text - which must still be legible when the page around it is dark."
}
